  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n@cluster2600 has fixed a lot of bugs for us🎉! Thank you!\r\n\r\n* Fix failing tests and run go test in CI by @cluster2600 in https://github.com/ddddddO/packemon/pull/296\r\n* Fix panics when showing packet details in Monitor by @cluster2600 in https://github.com/ddddddO/packemon/pull/290\r\n* Fix checksum calculation and IPv4 fragment offset encoding by @cluster2600 in https://github.com/ddddddO/packemon/pull/291\r\n* Fix offset of ICMPv6 Router Solicitation options by @cluster2600 in https://github.com/ddddddO/packemon/pull/292\r\n* Skip nil links in tc.Close and return close errors by @cluster2600 in https://github.com/ddddddO/packemon/pull/294\r\n* Receive frames up to 65536 bytes on Linux by @cluster2600 in https://github.com/ddddddO/packemon/pull/293\r\n* Filter IPv6 frames in TLSv1.2 custom impl for IPv6 on mac/win by @cluster2600 in https://github.com/ddddddO/packemon/pull/295\r\n* Fix/auto calcu by @ddddddO in https://github.com/ddddddO/packemon/pull/300\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ddddddO/packemon/compare/v1.8.33...v1.8.34",
